Hernes are out, as the numbers know. Richard Martens referees, with a low card record the numbers already use; neither side plays in midweek, so my only move is a small trim to goals for Vaessen and Hateboer's return.","goals":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-3,"call":"Around 3.8 goals","text":"The numbers say 3.9 goals, 2.8 for Groningen, and already add for Willem II's leaky defence (22 conceded in six), Groningen's own recent conceding (31 this season) and Tjoe-A-On's ban. Part of Groningen's conceding came with stand-in keeper Stubljar, and first-choice keeper Vaessen and right-back Hateboer are back from their bans, which the numbers can't see, so I trim slightly to about 3.8. Willem II's possible extra absences (Muller, and doubts over Van Aalst and Didillon) come from single reports, so I don't add for them."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 10 corners","text":"The numbers say 10.3 corners, 6.3 for Groningen, already trimmed for Groningen winning fewer corners lately (21 in six). Bottom side Willem II, without Tjoe-A-On on the flank, should spend long spells defending, and Hateboer's return adds a right-back who gets forward, but OOG TV notes Lukkien may play two right-backs and drop a midfielder, which points nowhere clear, so I stay at about 10.3."},"cards":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Under 4.5 cards","text":"The numbers say 2.6 cards. Richard Martens has shown about 2.8 cards a game in four matches, below the league average of 3.1, and the numbers already count him and Willem II's rise in bookings (12 in six, including Tjoe-A-On's two yellows at Twente). Both clubs need a win badly, but it is not a derby, so I stay at about 2.6."},"shots":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 30 shots","text":"The numbers say 30.4 shots, 21.4 for Groningen. Willem II have allowed 128 shots in their last six, including 0-7 at PSV and 1-6 at Cambuur, while Groningen keep creating at home through Van Bergen and Willumsson (nine goals each) despite their results; the numbers already add that momentum (+7.5% for Groningen), so I stay at about 30."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 11 on target","text":"The numbers say 10.9 shots on target, 7.6 for Groningen, already raised 11% for Groningen's sharp recent shooting (40 on target in six) and lowered for Willem II's blunt attack (15 in six). Vaessen's return changes how many go in rather than how many are on target, so I stay at about 10.9."},"sources":["https://www.oogtv.nl/2026/11/fc-groningen-met-teruggekeerde-vaessen-hateboer-en-lukkien-in-eigen-huis-tegen-willem-ii/","https://www.fcgfans.nl/willem-ii-mist-verdediger-tegen-fc-groningen-door-domme-schorsing/","https://www.voetbalzone.nl/nieuws/waar-je-FC%20Groningen-vs-Willem%20II-kunt-kijken-tv-zender-online-livestream-aanvangstijdstip-en-recente-vorm-van-beide-teams/blt83397aa939699c17","https://www.tilbo.com/matchday-1-willem-ii-en-fc-groningen-hebben-behoefte-aan-zege/","https://www.blessuresenschorsingen.nl/"],"written_at":"2026-11-26T23:04:08Z"},"league":"eredivisie","take":{"applied":true,"written_at":"2026-11-26T23:04:08Z","goals":{"home":2.738,"away":1.018,"total":3.756,"adjust_pct":-3.0,"sized":true,"lean":"lower","home_win":0.725,"draw":0.17,"away_win":0.105,"over":{"1.5":0.899,"2.5":0.724,"3.5":0.517},"over_show":{"1.5":0.899,"2.5":0.724,"3.5":0.517,"4.5":0.324,"5.5":0.178},"btts":0.607,"likely_scores":[{"score":"2-1","p":0.089},{"score":"2-0","p":0.088},{"score":"3-1","p":0.081},{"score":"3-0","p":0.08},{"score":"1-1","p":0.075}],"clean_sheet_home":0.361,"clean_sheet_away":0.065,"range":[1,6],"take_line":{"over":{"line":"1.5","p":0.899,"shown":true},"under":{"line":"5.5","p":0.822,"shown":true}}},"corners":{"home":6.316,"away":3.981,"total":10.297,"adjust_pct":0.0,"sized":true,"lean":"same","over":{"8.5":0.678,"9.5":0.565,"10.5":0.451,"11.5":0.344},"over_show":{"8.5":0.678,"9.5":0.565,"10.5":0.451,"11.5":0.344,"12.5":0.252},"range":[6,15],"take_line":{"over":{